   "description": "Official BONELAB bindings for etee Controllers. Curl the middle finger to grab; straighten it to release. Squeeze the index finger to shoot/select without thumb contact. Left trackpad moves. Right trackpad turns outside a 60% centre deadzone; return to centre between turns and select snap turning in-game if available. Right trackpad centre click retains stick-click. Upper slider retains A/X actions. Double-tap and hold the lower slider to open the inventory/menu (B/Y); release after selection.",
